      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: I'll go ahead and say this since this has been a bug for a much longer time. It isn't anything major or detracts from the experience, but it's on topic to this. An animated object on your avatar that is summoned through an override will not animate in the mirror if it's culled in your normal view. Basically, if it's not viewable in any other way, it will just stop on the last frame it was seen in. Again, it's not anything major, this issue is only seen clientside, but it's on the same subject.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
