      "mergeID": "5c2967e8eb18206dd17a47cb",
      "mergedPostDetails": "To me, I've always loved VRChat for the ability to create my own particle effects and see them visually casting off the center/origin of the effect, the avatar. I'm not sure there remains a way to do this, which for me has taken away something really substantial from the game. If there could just be a way to locally toggle in our own settings, the ability to see just our own particles in the mirror and on camera, that would be stellar.",
