      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "For me it's very inconsistent what is shown in the mirror and what not when it comes to particles. But it is super annoying. I'd like to have some nice thumbnails and screenshots but this is close to impossible. Mirrors do not reflect almost everything, The ingame camera doesn't as well and world cameras only in rare cases.\n\nI have a bunch of particle systems in GameObjects with a fixed joint.\n\nOne is always active and follows my feet. It doesn't show trails but it does show the particle itself (mesh sphere with shader).\n\nOne is on my back, toggled with the inventory system. It is fully shown in mirrors with particle and trail when I toggle it. But it stays when I untoggle it.\n\nThe rest which follows hands and armature triggered with gesture combinations doesn't show up at all in mirrors.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
